#: patterns/faq.php:24
msgid "Is Hi WPEssential free?"
msgstr "Hi WPEssential 是免费的吗？"

#: patterns/faq.php:25
msgid "Yes. The theme and 12 demos are free forever. Pro unlocks 40+ demos, premium blocks and priority support."
msgstr "是的。主题和 12 个演示永久免费。Pro 可解锁 40+ 个演示、高级区块和优先支持。"

#: patterns/faq.php:30
msgid "Which page builders are supported?"
msgstr "支持哪些页面构建器？"

#: patterns/faq.php:31
msgid "The native block editor (Gutenberg) and Elementor. Every demo ships in both versions."
msgstr "原生区块编辑器（Gutenberg）和 Elementor。每个演示都提供这两个版本。"

#: patterns/faq.php:36
msgid "Will importing a demo delete my content?"
msgstr "导入演示会删除我的内容吗？"

#: patterns/faq.php:37
msgid "No. Demo content is added alongside your existing posts, and you choose what to import."
