#: patterns/faq.php:42
msgid "Do I need Elementor Pro?"
msgstr "我需要 Elementor Pro 吗？"

#: patterns/faq.php:43
msgid "No. Elementor free is enough for every demo. Elementor Pro Theme Builder headers and footers are also supported."
msgstr "不需要。免费版 Elementor 即可满足所有演示。同时也支持 Elementor Pro 主题构建器的页眉和页脚。"

#: patterns/faq.php:48
